WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,090
What do I need in exchange for some votes?

2
00:00:02,610 --> 00:00:04,810
Industrial coupons, sugar coupons, Fuji coupons, high point coupons

3
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:06,410
Soap tickets and match tickets are also required.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,700
Industrial coupons are tight, fares are high, prices are good, things need to be genuine

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:16,020
Five industrial coupons

6
00:00:16,260 --> 00:00:29,160
Including candy tickets, Fuji tickets, high point tickets, soap tickets, and match tickets, the total is 20 yuan.

7
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:52,800
Broken flowers and red plaid are shameless, three yuan and seventy-five cents each, no vote for ten feet of fruit candy, one pound of Susu, two bags of belongings.

8
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,360
Little by little, things were set up

9
00:00:59,690 --> 00:01:01,050
It’s time to go back and plan to build a house.
